{"id":"CVE-2017-7869","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2017-04-14T04:30:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-05T16:19:29.291Z","description":"GnuTLS before 2017-02-20 has an out-of-bounds write caused by an integer overflow and heap-based buffer overflow related to the cdk_pkt_read function in opencdk/read-packet.c. This issue (which is a subset of the vendor's GNUTLS-SA-2017-3 report) is fixed in 3.5.10.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://bugs.chromium.org/p/oss-fuzz/issues/detail?id=420","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://gitlab.com/gnutls/gnutls/commit/51464af713d71802e3c6d5ac15f1a95132a354fe","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:2292","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_REDHAT"],"name":"RHSA-2017:2292"},{"url":"https://www.gnutls.org/security.html","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/97040","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_BID"],"name":"97040"}],"vendors":["crypto-libs"]}
